<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Heritage Media raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Heritage Media raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Heritage Media Corp to trading buy from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Heritage Media gained 3/8 to 18-1/4.</p>
</text>
